Errrmm...  The above fragment snuck in when I moved my Red Hat
email from one machine to another, forgot to also copy my
.signature over, and had an "auto" signature generator left
around from before in my previous config.  It was auto-appended
to the bottom of my mail.  I just thought I'd mention that in 
case anyone was confused by the Douglas Adams C style humor that 
got appended randomly.

Signature generator disabled now.  ;o)


