The PowerStorm 350 card isn't supported by XFree86 - I think its because
the inner workings are proprietary.  Until such time that Compaq / Evans
and Sutherland release this information these cards are useless for
Linux (too bad- they work great on Tru64)  

I recommend a PCI ATI Radeon card.  You can get one for less than $100
and it works great on Linux Alpha.

