it since.

But other than this alpha, I don't know much about where it stands in the
line of alpha machines, how good it really is, how far can I upgrade it,
etc... and am hoping to find more info on it since it's a box I really like.
I'm pissed I that I don't have my TRS-80 Model III anymore, but this is one
I don't want to give up, for reasons I don't yet know :) And just like my
TRS-80 Model III, I'm finding out it's very quirky!

Any info/links much appreciated.






