> Are you sure ? I wonder because
> a) Does stock RH on intel contain BSD support

No, but it is not a big deal to make a custom kernel with this included.

> b) Files can be much larger on alpha than on intel,

Not anymore.  With current kernels and libraries LFS is a standard.

