I sometime see this simmilar messages on my LX as well. Usually it
helps to supply the flag
-fl "i"
at boot and try it several times. "i" brings you to the aboot prompt,
where you then select your boot options (press "l" to see them and
then the number to select). Also I remember reading on the list, that
it sometimes helps to let the machine sit at the SRM prompt for a while
(up to 24 h) before actually booting it (search the archives for
details).

Greetings

